 433:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/Endpoint_AVR8.h **** 			/** Returns a mask indicating which INTERRUPT type endpoints have interrupted - i.e. their
 434:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/Endpoint_AVR8.h **** 			 *  interrupt duration has elapsed. Which endpoints have interrupted can be determined by
 435:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/Endpoint_AVR8.h **** 			 *  masking the return value against <tt>(1 << <i>{Endpoint Number}</i>)</tt>.
