 149:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/Device_AVR8.h **** 			/** Returns the current USB frame number, when in device mode. Every millisecond the USB bus is 
 150:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/Device_AVR8.h **** 			 *  the frame number is incremented by one.
